    "sections": {
        "description": "Pest Control Treatment is a professional and versatile theme designed for commercial and residential pest control services, including termite treatment, rodent control, bed bug removal, ant control, mosquito management, cockroach extermination, flea treatment, organic pest solutions, eco-friendly pest control, and general pest management, while supporting ecommerce functionality for selling pest control products, service packages, inspection tools, preventive solutions, and digital guides through seamless WooCommerce integration suited for ecommerce templates, dropshipping shop setups, and online store building. Crafted with a clean, modern, and fully responsive design, it offers easy branding customization, retina-ready layouts, detailed service listings, testimonial sections, team profiles, and clear call-to-action buttons to build trust and drive inquiries. Contact Form 7 enables appointment requests, inspections, and lead collection, while Yoast SEO compatibility improves search visibility for key terms such as pest control services, pest control near me, termite control, bed bug treatment, and professional extermination solutions. Ideal for pest control companies, eco-friendly service providers, and residential or commercial specialists, this theme delivers a conversion-focused platform to showcase services, manage bookings, promote pest prevention plans, and grow an effective online presence.Demo:https://www.vwthemes.net/pest-control-treatment/ Demo: https://www.vwthemes.net/pest-control-treatment/"
    },
